(The Method of Joints isolates individual pin joints as free body diagrams of concurrent) Tj
T*
(force systems:) Tj
T*
(* Step 1: Determine global external support reactions by treating the entire truss as) Tj
T*
(a rigid body: Sigma Fx = 0, Sigma Fy = 0, Sigma M = 0.) Tj
T*
(* Step 2: Select a joint having at least one known force and NOT MORE THAN TWO) Tj
T*
(unknown member forces.) Tj
