(* Step 3: Draw joint FBD, assuming unknown member forces are Tensile \(arrows pointing) Tj
T*
(away from the pin\).) Tj
T*
(* Step 4: Apply concurrent equilibrium: Sigma Fx = 0, Sigma Fy = 0. A positive) Tj
T*
(calculated value confirms tension \(+T\); a negative value denotes compression \(-C\).) Tj
T*
(* Step 5: Advance sequentially to adjacent joints until all member forces are) Tj
T*
(computed.) Tj
