T*
(equal panels of b = 4 m each and height h = 3 m. Vertical loads of 30 kN each act) Tj
T*
(downward at lower panel joints L1, L2, L3. Determine the forces in top chord U1U2,) Tj
T*
(diagonal U1L2, and bottom chord L1L2 by the Method of Sections.) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 1: Global Support Reactions at L0 and L4:) Tj
T*
(Total load = 30 + 30 + 30 = 90 kN. By symmetry: R_L0 = R_L4 = 90 / 2 = 45 kN \(upward\).) Tj
T*
(Solution Step 2: Pass cutting plane section 1-1:) Tj
